{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124389","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124389/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124389/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124389/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124389","id":5807132795,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABWiHQew","number":124389,"title":"Game treated as another window of the editor on Wayland","user":{"login":"BlankEclair","id":170076830,"node_id":"U_kgDOCiMqng","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/170076830?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlankEclair","html_url":"https://github.com/BlankEclair","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlankEclair/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlankEclair/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlankEclair/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlankEclair/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlankEclair/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlankEclair/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlankEclair/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlankEclair/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlankEclair/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-10-12T01:37:49Z","updated_at":"2026-10-12T09:14:38Z","closed_at":"2026-10-12T06:34:45Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nGodot v4.7.2.stable (ed1daf0bf)\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.2.stable (ed1daf0bf) - Fedora Linux 44 (KDE Plasma Desktop Edition) on Wayland - Wayland display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated Intel(R) Iris(R) Xe Graphics (ADL GT2) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-1255U (12 threads) - 15.32 GiB memory - PulseAudio (44100 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen running the game from the editor on Wayland, the game is treated by the compositor (or at least KDE Plasma) as a window of the editor, and treats it accordingly (has the Godot icon in the taskbar, and is grouped in with the editor in the taskbar).\n\nI'd expect it the game to not be grouped alongside the editor, and to have the seperate icon displayed in the taskbar (when set).\n\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b6e69ab8-2d33-4fd6-b0fd-c01363fe83ec\" />\n\nThis does not happen when the game is launched from an exported binary:\n\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/378e861a-b5a6-4d28-8d88-031beaafd5af\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n* Open the MRP, or:\n  * Set an icon in Project Settings\n  * Set driver.linuxbsd to wayland\n* Start the project in the editor\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[mre.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/33317129/mre.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"BlankEclair","id":170076830,"node_id":"U_kgDOCiMqng","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/170076830?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlankEclair","html_url":"https://github.com/BlankEclair","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlankEclair/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlankEclair/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlankEclair/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlankEclair/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlankEclair/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlankEclair/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlankEclair/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlankEclair/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlankEclair/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124389/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124389/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"not_planned","pinned_comment":null}